  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Intransitive pair: ⟦{散|ち}らかる→散らかる：04357_chirakaru⟧ (to be messy).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates resulting state or ongoing action. {散|ち}らかしている = 'has made messy' or 'is making messy.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{散|ち}らかす (to scatter X, make X messy)\n- ⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{散|ち}らかす (to mess up a room)\n- {散|ち}らかさないで (don't make a mess)\n\nINTRANSITIVE PAIR:\n- {散|ち}らかす (transitive) - to make messy\n- ⟦{散|ち}らかる→散らかる：04357_chirakaru⟧ (intransitive) - to be messy\n\nNOTE: Often used in negative requests: {散|ち}らかさないで！ (Don't make a mess!)",
